      "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_02.mp3",
      "text": "Men like you call people like me demons, so no.  I don't trust you.",
      "duration": 3.898
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Venator",
      "audioFile": "priest_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/priest_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_03.mp3",
      "text": "Young man, I don't care about the circumstances of your birth, I care about who you are.  I don't give a damn if you look like a monster\u2026. But if you act like one I will put you down.",
      "duration": 10.568
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Apollo",
      "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_priest_convo02_04.mp3",
      "text": "Yeah I definitely don't trust you.",
      "duration": 2.118
    }
  ]
